OL,3,GNEWSASacked London Pride boss given    
OL,4,Asuspended prison sentence              
OL,6,FThe sacked boss of London Pride has    
OL,7,Fbeen handed a suspended prison sentence
OL,8,Fafter "harvesting" confidential        
OL,9,Fdocuments to disrupt an investigation  
OL,10,Finto his alleged misconduct and set up 
OL,11,Fhis own rival company.                 
OL,13,FLondon's High Court heard how          
OL,14,FChristopher Joell-Deshields had        
OL,15,Fdownloaded more than 50 private        
OL,16,Fdocuments just days after agreeing to a
OL,17,Fcourt order to hand over all company   
OL,18,Fproperty.                              
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
