OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASacked London Pride boss given    
OL,4,Asuspended prison sentence              
OL,6,FMr Justice Cotter said the 55-year-old 
OL,7,Fhad downloaded documents on a "large   
OL,8,Fand significant scale" with the        
OL,9,Fintention of "disrupting the           
OL,10,Forganisation" and "advancing his own   
OL,11,Fcauses".                               
OL,13,FLawyers for Joell-Deshields said he had
OL,14,Fmental health issues and couldn't      
OL,15,Frecall deliberately downloading private
OL,16,Finformation.                           
